## SQ-TER-02 | ponds and the swamp fisherman house sit on a slope
> pbot spawn qa 0 150 0 minecraft:overworld creative
> execute positioned 2144 70 -2592 run locate biome minecraft:windswept_hills
waitlog nearest minecraft:windswept_hills is at 300
capture HL is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {HL1} 200 {HL3}
sleep 25
> execute positioned {HL1} 120 {HL3} run place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_common
> execute positioned {HL1+60} 120 {HL3} run place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_carp
> execute positioned {HL1-60} 120 {HL3} run place structure old_swamp_fisherman_house:fisherman_house
reject (?i)failed to place|unknown structure
look positions {HL1},{HL3} / +60 / -60: no square pad or air notch, water stays in the pond, rim flush with the slope; carp: no 4-block dip or plinth (ST-300)

